# AI Edition sources are stored and checked out as LF.
#
# Committing CRLF into the blob makes git's autocrlf add a second CR on every
# checkout, which doubles every line in the working tree and silently breaks
# any tooling that matches on exact text. Pinning eol here stops that.
ai/**            text eol=lf
src/uqm/ai/**    text eol=lf
docs/**          text eol=lf
